    <h3 id="context-session-clear">POST /context/session/clear</h3>
    <p>Clear session state used for context diffing. Call this when a conversation ends or to reset diff tracking.</p>
    <h4>Request</h4>
    <pre><code class="language-json">&#123; "sessionId": "session-42" &#125;</code></pre>
    <h4>Response</h4>
    <pre><code class="language-text">Session 'session-42' cleared</code></pre>

